 reneurship\nDetails: https://www.law.cam.ac.uk/events/cambridge-comparativ
 e-constitutional-law-discussion-group-cccldg-work-progress-session-0\nDate
 /time: \n\n Wednesday 18 November 2026 \n\n 1:00pm to 2:00pm\n\n Location:
  \n\n Online webinar\n\n Sign up\n\n About \n\n Speaker: Yi-Chen Huang (Ac
 ademia Sinica)\n The Cambridge Comparative Constitutional Law Discussion G
 roup (CCCLDG)\, co-convened by Zheng Hong See and Even Y. Chao.\n CCCLDG i
 s a forum that brings together graduate students interested in comparative
  constitutional law and public law in general to discuss recent works and 
 developments in comparative constitutional law.\n Please join the mailing 
 list to receive updates and details of CCCLDG events.\n Convenors of CCCLD
 G 2026-27: Zheng Hong See ( zhs23@cam.ac.uk ) and Even Y. Chao ( yyc41@cam
 .ac.uk ).
